    "title": "0",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "ふっふっふ！\n今日って何の日か知ってる～？",
            "enText": "Hehehe! Do you know what day it is?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 7757116792290449672,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "はーっはっは！\nもちろん、わかるとも！",
            "enText": "Haaa-ha-ha! Why, of course I do!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -3732149483670803893,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "ズバリ……ボクが\n初めて1人でおつかいに行った日さ！",
            "enText": "It is none other… than the day I was \nentrusted with my very first solo errand!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 5623726455170536477,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "ええーっ！　そうなんだ！\nすごいねぇ！",
            "enText": "Whaaat? No way! That's so cool!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -7588992325096526059,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "って、違う違う違うよー！\nそうじゃなくって、わたしの、何かの日なの！",
            "enText": "Wait, no, no, no! That's not it! \nToday's a special day for <i>me!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 2193635148682538480,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "ええっとぉ……ウララさんが\n初めてレースで走った日、ですかぁ？",
            "enText": "Umm… Is it the day you first ran \nin a race, maybe?",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 4347286311624244480,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "えっ、そうだったのー！？",
            "enText": "Whoa, it was?!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -4281422804274255273,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "って、違うよぅ～！\nええっと、だからね、ヒントはね――",
            "enText": "Wait, no, not that either! \nHm, okay, here's a hint…",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -1860273597534601419,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "なんてね、サプライズさ！\r\nじれったいボク、刺激的だったろう？",
            "enText": "We only jest — it was a surprise! My teasing \nheightened the suspense, did it not?",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 8479919338877557039,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "と、いうわけで！\r\nそろそろ『乾杯の歌』といこう！",
            "enText": "Now then, let us celebrate \nthis joyful occasion!",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -7014122643298288450,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "ハッピーバースデー、ウララ！\r\nよい1年を！",
            "enText": "Happy birthday, Urara! \nHere's to a good year ahead!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": 4874019772631757560,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "ふふ。ちょっぴり、どきどきしました～。\nおめでとうございます～……！",
            "enText": "Hehe. I got a little nervous there… \nHappy birthday!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": -483032853370422983,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
